  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">L&rsquo;Associaci&oacute; del Ball d&rsquo;Onda, en colaboraci&oacute;n con la clase de baile de sevillanas Esencia a Ti, colaboran una vez m&aacute;s con la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC), esta vez cediendo los beneficios econ&oacute;micos de la venta de bolsos artesanales realizados a mano por Mar&iacute;a &Aacute;ngeles S&aacute;nchez. Se trata de varios modelos decorados con dibujos originales y flores de tela, con la frase &lsquo;Soy flamenca, &iquest;y t&uacute;?&rsquo;.</font></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-1.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-2.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-3.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-4.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-5.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-6.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/bolso-7.jpg\" alt=\"bolso-7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/amicsballondabeneficiaccc/img_7366.jpg\" al